msgid "_About Gear LeverR"
msgstr "_Acerca de Gear LeverR"

msgid "Welcome to Gear LeverR"
msgstr "Bienvenido a Gear LeverR"

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR is not integrated into your desktop yet. Choose how it should be "
"installed and where to keep your AppImages."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR todavía no está integrado en tu escritorio. Elige cómo "
"instalarlo y dónde guardar tus AppImages."

msgid "When adding an AppImage"
msgstr "Al añadir un AppImage"

msgid "Turn it off to keep the original file and clone it instead."
msgstr "Desactívalo para conservar el archivo original y clonarlo en su lugar."

msgid "Install and open Gear LeverR"
msgstr "Instalar y abrir Gear LeverR"

msgid "Not now"
msgstr "Ahora no"

msgid "Cannot determine the running AppImage"
msgstr "No se puede determinar el AppImage en ejecución"

msgid "Gear LeverR installed"
msgstr "Gear LeverR instalado"

msgid "Remove Gear LeverR?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar Gear LeverR?"

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR will be removed together with its desktop entry and the "
"application will close. Removing only Gear LeverR keeps the other AppImages "
"integrated."
msgstr ""
"Se eliminará Gear LeverR junto con su acceso al menú y la aplicación se "
"cerrará. Si eliminas solo Gear LeverR, el resto de AppImages seguirán "
"integradas."

msgid "Remove Gear LeverR"
msgstr "Eliminar Gear LeverR"

msgid "Remove all AppImages"
msgstr "Eliminar todos los AppImages"

msgid "Remove all AppImages?"
msgstr "¿Eliminar todos los AppImages?"

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR is the only integrated AppImage. It will be removed and the "
"application will close."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR es el único AppImage integrado. Se eliminará y la aplicación se "
"cerrará."

msgid ""
"This removes all {count} integrated AppImages, including Gear LeverR, and "
"the application will close."
msgstr ""
"Se eliminarán los {count} AppImages integrados, incluida Gear LeverR, y se "
"cerrará la aplicación."

msgid "AppImages removed"
msgstr "AppImages eliminadas"

